WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.406
Your first month at Magppie is sixteen tasks across five phases — from the day before you join, to your one-month review.

1.2
00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:14.812
It is heavily front-loaded: ten of those sixteen happen on your first day.

2.1
00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:21.621
It starts the day before you arrive.

2.2
00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:28.431
H R calls to confirm your reporting time, talk through your commute, and offer help with directions or parking.

2.3
00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:35.240
You also get a note with the joining essentials — which documents to carry, the dress code, and who to ask for at reception.

3.1
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:42.386
Day one carries ten of the sixteen tasks.

3.2
00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:49.531
Your welcome kit.

3.3
00:00:49.531 --> 00:00:56.677
Your company-allotted assets and stationery.

3.4
00:00:56.677 --> 00:01:03.823
Your credentials — email I D and Keka login.

3.5
00:01:03.823 --> 00:01:10.969
A briefing on H R policy, and a welcome email with that policy attached along with your Magppie study materials.

3.6
00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:18.114
Joining formalities are completed — the joining form, N D A, L O A, and self-attestation of documents.

3.7
00:01:18.114 --> 00:01:25.260
Then introductions to leaders and the departments you will work with, you are added to the Magppie Champions WhatsApp group with an intro post, you receive a personalised welcome message once your company number is issued, and finally the contact details of the people most relevant to your role.

4.1
00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:32.320
In your first week, H R and your reporting manager assign you a buddy from your own team.

5.1
00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:41.972
At day seven there is an informal feedback conversation about your overall experience so far — the positives and the negatives both.

6.1
00:01:41.972 --> 00:01:53.064
At thirty days it becomes formal: an H R review meeting with you, and manager feedback on conduct, fitment, work quality and values.

7.1
00:01:53.064 --> 00:02:00.158
That is the whole first month.

7.2
00:02:00.158 --> 00:02:07.252
Sixteen tasks, five phases, and a named owner on every single one — so nothing is left to chance, and nobody has to guess what happens next.

